{"_v":1,"id":"fela-2009","cs":82,"rc":9,"bd":{"positive":7,"mixed":2,"negative":0},"rv":[{"cn":"Ben Brantley","o":"The New York Times","s":94,"b":"Rave","t":1,"u":"https://www.nytimes.com/2009/11/24/theater/reviews/24fela.html","d":"2009-11-24","q":"There has never been anything on Broadway like this production."},{"cn":"Jennifer Farrar","o":"Associated Press","s":86,"b":"Rave","t":1,"u":"https://www.newstimes.com/entertainment/article/Review-Fela-dance-party-finds-its-way-to-B-way-262086.php","d":"2009-11-23","q":"\"Fela!\" is a unique Broadway experience that leaves the audience on their feet and wanting more."},{"cn":"Charles Isherwood","o":"Variety","s":83,"b":"Rave","t":1,"u":"https://variety.com/2009/legit/reviews/fela-3-1200477297/","d":"2009-11-23","q":"Such political passion is not exactly commonplace in a Broadway musical, but it’s one of many ways in which “Fela!” breaks the mold."},{"cn":"David Cote","o":"Time Out New York","s":80,"b":"Positive","t":1,"u":"https://www.timeout.com/newyork/theater/fela","d":"2009-11-24","q":"Fela! is more than a musical; it's an ecstatic phenomenon."},{"cn":"Elisabeth Vincentelli","o":"New York Post","s":78,"b":"Positive","t":1,"u":"https://www.nypost.com/p/entertainment/theater/plenty_of_afro_heat_kQGx3P1vFBYrLx0bbPQ1VK","d":"2009-09-24","q":"This is as close as Broadway gets to fully immersive theater."},{"cn":"Terry Teachout","o":"The Wall Street Journal","s":73,"b":"Positive","t":1,"u":"https://www.wsj.com/articles/SB10001424052748704013004574517680589230494?gaa_at=eafs&gaa_n=AWEtsqcIR5-MFpbAKxuP8PAAMZoRl3Sl8be4ZHxvfqui2FBekXnLQ_ncoCqd&gaa_ts=69a8fe76&gaa_sig=9on3xjumf1MPzqrP1ZUfKj8khD58FRxTQZSwon0_vrVkgJWAQElXqA-epYcn6WAHy9G9ugyexH9LEKMcoU2ylQ%3D%3D","d":"2009-11-25","q":"What saves 'Fela!' from being a mindless celebration is that it doesn't soft-pedal the complexities of its subject"},{"cn":"Elysa Gardner","o":"USA Today","s":88,"b":"Rave","t":2,"u":"https://www.usatoday.com/life/theater/reviews/2009-11-24-fela24_st_N.htm","d":"2009-11-23","q":"Fela! earns its exclamation point, joyfully and relentlessly."},{"cn":"John Simon","o":"Bloomberg","s":76,"b":"Positive","t":2,"u":"https://www.newyorktheatreguide.com/reviews/fela"},{"cn":"Michael Sommers","o":"New Jersey Newsroom","s":68,"b":"Mixed","t":3,"u":"https://www.newjerseynewsroom.com/movies/afrobeat-music-drives-broadways-new-fela","q":"Broadway has never before witnessed a musical quite like \"Fela!\" - an explosive mix of catchy Afrobeat rhythms, wild, sexy dancing and raw bio-dramatics - and while its unique charms certainly are powerful, one frankly wonders whether this unusual show will catch on with the mainstream public."}],"au":{"score":63,"designation":"Disliking","sources":{"mz":{"s":63,"c":26,"sr":3.2}}},"ta":"230 W 49th St, New York, NY 10019","pd":"2009-10-19","ca":[{"n":"Kevin Mambo","r":"Fela Anikulapo-Kuti"},{"n":"Sahr Ngaujah","r":"Fela Anikulapo-Kuti"},{"n":"Saycon Sengbloh","r":"Sandra"},{"n":"Lillias White","r":"Funmilayo"},{"n":"Anne V. Andre","r":"Ensemble"},{"n":"Corey Baker","r":"Ensemble"},{"n":"Hettie Vyrine Barnhill","r":"Ensemble"},{"n":"Lauren De Veaux","r":"Ensemble"},{"n":"Nicole Chantal de Weever","r":"Ensemble"},{"n":"Rujeko Dumbutshena","r":"Ensemble"},{"n":"Rasaan Elijah \"Talu\" Green","r":"Ensemble"},{"n":"Shaneeka Harrell","r":"Ensemble"},{"n":"Ismael Kouyaté","r":"African Chanter"},{"n":"Gelan Lambert","r":"J.K. Braiman"},{"n":"Shakira Marshall","r":"Ensemble"},{"n":"Afi McClendon","r":"Ensemble"},{"n":"Maia McKinney","r":"Ensemble"},{"n":"Adesola Osakalumi","r":"Ensemble"},{"n":"Jeffrey Page","r":"Ensemble"},{"n":"Daniel Soto","r":"Ensemble"},{"n":"Jill M. Vallery","r":"Ensemble"},{"n":"Iris Wilson","r":"Ensemble"},{"n":"Aimee Graham Wodobode","r":"Ensemble"}]}